        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- src:2490 | (10) A provincial court judge may issue a warrant under subsection (6) or include in an order made under subsection (3) a requirement set out in subsection (9) only if they are satisfied that there is no other way to ensure that the terms and conditions of that order can reasonably be complied with.
@ref s 117.0101(10) (src:2490)
GIVEN `the judge is satisfied that there is no other way to ensure that the terms and conditions of that order can reasonably be complied with` IS A BOOLEAN
