        IF `the application is to revoke an order made under subsection (1) or vary any of its terms and conditions` AND (`the application is made to the provincial court judge who made the order` OR `the application is made to another provincial court judge`) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- src:2525 | (5) For greater certainty, if a date is fixed under subsection 117.0104(1) for the hearing of an application made under subsection 117.011(1), any order made under this section that is still in force applies in respect of that hearing.
@ref s 117.0103(5) (src:2525)
